    "detailed_description": "<strong>BAAM SQUAD</strong> is a VR zombie co-op shooter following a band of four brave agents seeking to shoot, loot and run in order to solve the mystery case of Santana's Sweets Factory: The place where it\u2019s been taken over by zombies eating human flesh and candies.<br><br>Select your hero, team up with other players, and navigate through infinite waves of zombies. Scout the locale and smash the undeads to protect yourself, using a diverse selection of weapons ranging from classic pistol to leading-edge laser gun.<br><br><strong> Join our Discord community: </strong><br>If you have any idea, feedback, and/or suggestion, we are here to listen! You can also find other players to co-op.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/f1c179f8f0ccd22df46a0b51ab2cdbc3.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/f1c179f8f0ccd22df46a0b51ab2cdbc3.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/f1c179f8f0ccd22df46a0b51ab2cdbc3.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><li> Journey into Sweets Factory \u2013 Complete with jelly trampolines, conveyor oven and hot chocolate falls. Vending machines are everywhere selling buffing snacks and mysterious sodas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/be247baf5b4e787cf69cede71912f93c.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/be247baf5b4e787cf69cede71912f93c.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/be247baf5b4e787cf69cede71912f93c.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Free Exploration \u2013 Use controller to walk or run without motion-sickness, teleportation and space restriction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/6cc11fb72587c61696f990d527e450ae.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/6cc11fb72587c61696f990d527e450ae.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/6cc11fb72587c61696f990d527e450ae.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Weapons \u2013 From classic pistol to Sci-Fi laser gun. Collect all 10+ weapons and upgrade them to MAX level, optimizing your chance to survive longer.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/85fbce9c9faaade723a9f88641f956ab.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/85fbce9c9faaade723a9f88641f956ab.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/85fbce9c9faaade723a9f88641f956ab.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> 4-players Co-op \u2013 Play with friends or other players around the world. Up to four players allowed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/2d82ff8ddf7397e76d971e30216b6bf9.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/2d82ff8ddf7397e76d971e30216b6bf9.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/2d82ff8ddf7397e76d971e30216b6bf9.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Global leaderboard \u2013 Mark your name on the top by killing as many zombies as you can. Headshot is the key to get high score and saving bullets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/a909117b8b435a9b242f459816e93c18.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/a909117b8b435a9b242f459816e93c18.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/a909117b8b435a9b242f459816e93c18.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Various Hand Interaction \u2013 Shoot guns, pull levers, throw objects and much more. You can also give hands to your friends who are bleeding out.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>BAAM SQUAD</strong> is a VR zombie co-op shooter following a band of four brave agents seeking to shoot, loot and run in order to solve the mystery case of Santana's Sweets Factory: The place where it\u2019s been taken over by zombies eating human flesh and candies.<br><br>Select your hero, team up with other players, and navigate through infinite waves of zombies. Scout the locale and smash the undeads to protect yourself, using a diverse selection of weapons ranging from classic pistol to leading-edge laser gun.<br><br><strong> Join our Discord community: </strong><br>If you have any idea, feedback, and/or suggestion, we are here to listen! You can also find other players to co-op.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/f1c179f8f0ccd22df46a0b51ab2cdbc3.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/f1c179f8f0ccd22df46a0b51ab2cdbc3.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/f1c179f8f0ccd22df46a0b51ab2cdbc3.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><li> Journey into Sweets Factory \u2013 Complete with jelly trampolines, conveyor oven and hot chocolate falls. Vending machines are everywhere selling buffing snacks and mysterious sodas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/be247baf5b4e787cf69cede71912f93c.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/be247baf5b4e787cf69cede71912f93c.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/be247baf5b4e787cf69cede71912f93c.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Free Exploration \u2013 Use controller to walk or run without motion-sickness, teleportation and space restriction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/6cc11fb72587c61696f990d527e450ae.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/6cc11fb72587c61696f990d527e450ae.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/6cc11fb72587c61696f990d527e450ae.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Weapons \u2013 From classic pistol to Sci-Fi laser gun. Collect all 10+ weapons and upgrade them to MAX level, optimizing your chance to survive longer.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/85fbce9c9faaade723a9f88641f956ab.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/85fbce9c9faaade723a9f88641f956ab.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/85fbce9c9faaade723a9f88641f956ab.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> 4-players Co-op \u2013 Play with friends or other players around the world. Up to four players allowed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/2d82ff8ddf7397e76d971e30216b6bf9.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/2d82ff8ddf7397e76d971e30216b6bf9.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/2d82ff8ddf7397e76d971e30216b6bf9.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Global leaderboard \u2013 Mark your name on the top by killing as many zombies as you can. Headshot is the key to get high score and saving bullets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/a909117b8b435a9b242f459816e93c18.poster.avif?t=1747372315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/a909117b8b435a9b242f459816e93c18.webm?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736720/extras/a909117b8b435a9b242f459816e93c18.mp4?t=1747372315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Various Hand Interaction \u2013 Shoot guns, pull levers, throw objects and much more. You can also give hands to your friends who are bleeding out.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "BAAM SQUAD is a VR zombie co-op shooter following a band of four brave agents seeking to shoot, loot and run in order to solve the mystery case of Santana's Sweets Factory: The place where it\u2019s been taken over by zombies eating human flesh and candies!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cSuper fun Zombie shooter where you can also play co-op with up to four players. Fun, fast and enjoyable does what a lot of other Zombie VR wave shooters forget to do, make it fun!\u201d<br>VIVE VR<br><br>\u201cIt's hard to find polished PVE 4 player Co-op VRgames. If you too are struggling to find good 4 player co-op games with your mates, consider getting this one. They have an active discord with active developers so that's always a good sign.\u201d<br>MATTATA<br><br>\u201cVirtually identical to the classic COD Zombies games. If you liked those, then you'll love this. It's well made and exciting action.\u201d<br>The Best Vive Games<br>",
